      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Update: Happens on Live 1554 and OpenBeta seems to be in sync (also 1554). It also happens if you ask the SDK to build and test with 4 copies, as the interval between each of them authorizing is way too short.\n\nNone of this has been happening before, but I've also upgraded my CPU so maybe VRC loads wayy to fast now.",
