  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Whenever Worlds SDK tries to load me into a corrupted/cancelled World Build, VRC tries to load into it repeadetly (over and over again in crazy short intervals) and that results in me getting ratelimited and basically locked out from interacting with both web and the game. I don't even know how long the ratelimit will last :(\n\nI can't get the build number since i'm locked out lol but it happens on CURRENT live and open beta.",
